0, "text": "This was the decisive move. GPT-6.1 Sol played H4, which lost 26.9 points and moved Black's lead from -0.3 to +26.6. The engine's choice was C7. White had just been handed the lead and gave all of it back at once."}, {"turn": 29, "text": "The 20k answered J7 with J8, the 20k's worst move at 16.9 points lost, which cut Black's lead from +42.5 to +25.6. The J-file fight was left looking much better for White than it had a move earlier, but Black stayed well ahead."}, {"turn": 54, "text": "With the left side sealed off, GPT-6.1 Sol played B8, losing 26.6 points and sending Black's lead from +37.0 to +63.6. The engine wanted B9, and one move later Black took B9 itself. GPT-6.1 Sol resigned with Black ahead by +61.0."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "The `auditfn` and `prepare` code only scanned the current board for chains, liberties, empty regions and the effect of one manually named move, then saved audit/response files. The SGF replay, validation and review writing were record-keeping, with no loop over empty points, no candidate ranking, no playouts and no look-ahead.", "stop": false}}